WEBVTT

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:03.430
Ooh...

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:05.940
<b>Takoyaki            Yakisoba            Yakitori</b>

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.650
Lately, they've been strangely excited.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.580
Morning, Yushi-kun.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.340
Ruriko-san's grilled squid is great!

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:25.290
Feeling like you're at a festival 
is a nice way to start the day!

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.520
I-Is it?

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:35.770
How are preparations for the school fair?

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:37.290
Perfect!

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:40.530
My tennis club is making crêpes!

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:42.510
Konatsu, come and try some.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:44.280
That's right...

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:47.020
Isn't the culture fair at 
Konatsu's school soon?

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:48.940
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:51.610
You don't want to get sick again.

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:53.400
Yeah.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:30.040
<b>Twenty-fourth Haunting 
The Storm Before the Storm</b>

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:33.470
That's enough.

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:36.300
Don't do harmful things anymore!

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:40.300
None of your impudence, woman pirate.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:42.850
Nobody can stop me!

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:46.350
Wake up, my dearest sister!

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:54.110
What am I doing? Sister?

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.280
You finally remember!

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:03.200
I'm so glad it had a happy ending.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:06.110
You're on the staff. Why are you crying?

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:09.080
Because she was released from the evil,

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.990
so they can go back to
being sisters who get along!

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.920
<i>Sisters who get along?</i>

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:30.310
Yamamoto?

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.360
You came, Yamamoto-san!

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:38.030
Are you going to help with the culture fair?

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:40.530
It's wonderful.

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:46.260
I wondered what you were 
all so excited about.

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:48.450
It's a play for a preschool?

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:50.400
That's wonderful.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.870
It's not for me, though.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:08.090
"My dearest sister...

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:11.410
My sister, whom I love so much..."

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.350
How stupid!

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:19.160
Getting serious about such a stupid play,

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:21.750
wasting your time and effort...

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:24.910
Think you can do anything, 
just because it's the culture fair?

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:26.740
That's amazing!

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:31.040
I'm so glad I transferred to JTB.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:35.620
At Jinmei, I'd have never seen 
wonderful people like you!

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:39.280
After seeing such a rare thing, 
my horizons have expanded.

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:41.030
Yamamoto-san, listen...

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.470
<b>Notice of Withdrawal from Club</b>

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:47.040
<i>A withdrawal notice?</i>

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:49.130
Thank you for everything.

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:51.930
Not that you did anything for me.

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:54.150
Hey, what does that mean?

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:55.140
Stop.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:57.770
<b>Notice of Withdrawal from Club</b>

00:04:58.760 --> 00:04:59.750
Club president...

00:05:00.010 --> 00:05:02.480
You're sure about this, right?

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:04.570
Of course.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.190
Okay. Got it.

00:05:11.220 --> 00:05:14.220
<i>She doesn't know what to do.</i>

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:16.510
Also, Inaba-senpai...

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:20.850
You're a boy in high school.

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:25.550
You shouldn't be showing off 
your mom's handmade lunches.

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:31.550
It's so pathetic, I had to laugh.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:39.890
I can forgive the rest, but not that!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.790
Tashiro, stop it.

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:46.480
I don't know what kind of problems 
you have with your family,

00:05:46.480 --> 00:05:50.140
but it doesn't mean you can 
talk about other people!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.480
That's enough, I said!

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:52.620
It isn't enough!

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:55.790
Inaba's mother is gone!

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.000
He lost both his parents at once!

00:06:05.670 --> 00:06:06.860
Yamamoto...

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:08.800
Yamamoto-san?

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:13.930
You tricked me...

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.260
How awful.

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:21.190
You tricked me.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.720
You laughed behind my back, didn't you?!

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:25.940
You said I'm an idiot
who doesn't know anything!

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:28.860
You can't honestly think we'd 
just talk about Inaba's family!

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:29.740
Shut up!

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.530
What do you know?!

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:35.200
How would you know how 
always being alone feels?

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:37.830
No one gives me any credit at home!

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:40.530
No one at school understands me!

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:43.510
No one! No one! No one!

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:46.090
No one lets me be part of the group!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:51.120
Just because your parents 
died, why are you special?!

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:53.140
Does that make you better than me?

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.930
She's gone crazy...

00:06:58.440 --> 00:06:59.810
What is this?

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:03.050
A terrible aura, master.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.020
Aura?

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:06.980
Rage. Envy. Jealousy.

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:10.280
All those negative feelings, 
blended together.

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:14.020
I have never seen such a negative aura.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.110
Yamamoto, that isn't true.

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:17.480
Listen to me...

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:19.700
Shut up. Shut up. Shut up!

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:23.780
I've done nothing wrong... Nothing!

00:07:23.780 --> 00:07:25.730
All of this is your fault!

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:30.630
I'm sorry.

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:36.060
I'm sorry.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:38.390
You're right.

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:40.610
It isn't your fault.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:42.740
You've done nothing wrong.

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:45.610
I'm so sorry for hurting you.

00:07:55.380 --> 00:07:56.860
<i>Yamamoto's aura...</i>

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:00.020
On everyone's behalf, I apologize.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.620
I'm sorry.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:02.790
<i>Hey!</i>

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:05.010
Isn't that right, everyone?

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:08.010
Let's all apologize and be friends.

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:09.210
You can do that, right?

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:12.380
That's impossible, Aoki-sensei.

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:15.080
We can't all hold hands and be friends.

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:17.300
This isn't kindergarten.

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:22.440
I see.

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:25.660
I thought I was being open 
and honest with you.

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:27.990
But it seems you didn't understand.

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:29.960
Now, stand up.

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:31.490
I'll hear you out.

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:33.400
Tell me whatever you want.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:35.360
O-Okay...

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:42.040
What the heck was that?

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.680
Are we supposed to be the bad guys here?

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.780
Hell, no...

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:49.450
All right, back to practice.

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:50.730
Get ready, everyone.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:52.200
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:58.030 --> 00:08:59.560
Really?

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:01.610
Aoki-sensei, you do, also?

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:04.720
I love Chekhov, too!

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:05.820
Really?

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:09.770
But it's amazing that you like Russian 
literature, Yamamoto-san.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.690
Is it?

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.530
<i>Someone who will always forgive you.</i>

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.700
<i>Someone who will always accept you.</i>

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:22.480
<i>Maybe Yamamoto needed someone like Aoki.</i>

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.690
<i>Not only Yamamoto.</i>

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.670
<i>All the students who look up to Aoki</i>

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:31.840
<i>are quiet, serious ones that 
don't stand out in class.</i>

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:35.970
<i>They lack self-confidence, 
and are unsatisfied and worried.</i>

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:39.630
<i>So Aoki, who never tells them they're wrong,</i>

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:43.440
<i>must be like a goddess to them.</i>

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:47.930
I guess even she can smile like that.

00:09:47.930 --> 00:09:50.520
But was this really for the best?

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:54.970
Who cares?

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:57.240
If it helped her, it helped.

00:09:57.580 --> 00:09:58.680
Chiaki-chan!

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:01.990
That's the one you were talking about, Inaba?

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:03.950
Yeah, but...

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.150
What?

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:07.800
Upset you couldn't solve 
the problem yourself?

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:10.690
Or did you want someone 
to say you did well?

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:12.420
I-It isn't like that!

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:16.420
It must have been fate, for them
to have met each other like this.

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:18.010
For now, isn't that enough?

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:22.250
<i>Fate, huh?</i>

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:41.530
You're going back to school?

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:45.150
Yeah, I just came home for some stuff.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:46.830
This is when the real work begins!

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:47.620
That's right.

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:51.460
Isn't tomorrow the first day 
of your school's culture fair?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:52.540
Yeah!

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:55.630
But who knows when the 
festival will end here?

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:57.090
<b>Goldfish Scooping</b>

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:58.420
This isn't even food now.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:58.340
<b>Balloon Scooping</b>

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:00.070
Hey.

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:02.390
This place has everything, right?

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:07.680
Why are you having fun here?

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:11.150
Isn't your own school's
culture fair coming up?

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:13.740
Is it okay for the student council 
president to play around?

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:14.610
Don't worry.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:17.690
I have the schedule worked out, 
right up until the start.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:22.360
As long as my talented staff do their 
jobs, everything will be fine.

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:24.970
Wow.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:26.540
Who do you think you are?

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:28.110
I am myself.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:32.920
But Yushi-kun's school seems a lot more fun.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.290
Who knows what will happen?

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.700
That's right!

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:39.700
That general assembly was great!

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:42.220
That's interesting.

00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:44.570
Please don't come.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:47.210
You guys coming will just make things worse.

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:49.720
Oh, my... Listen to you.

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:51.760
But he might be right!

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:55.070
Jeez...

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:59.910
Don't get too tense and push yourself.

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:00.850
Yeah.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.890
It's nearly done, though.

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:05.570
If I'm doing the culture fair, 
I want it to be great.

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:08.650
That's just like you.

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:13.710
Work hard, Inaba.

00:12:14.030 --> 00:12:14.820
Yeah.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:17.380
<b></b>

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:19.300
What's this?

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:20.570
Here.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:28.510
<b></b>

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:25.810
This is a pamphlet for the JTB Culture Fair!

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:28.500
He must have gotten it from Yushi-kun's room!

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:29.970
Great work!

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:32.500
Okay, time for a strategy meeting!

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:33.940
Yeah!

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:39.910
These days, culture fairs 
are quite a spectacle.

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:41.580
They have a haunted house!

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.650
Maybe I'll show 'em how it's really done!

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:43.900
<b>Oni-Hunting Game 
1:  Try    Yen</b>

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:47.620
<b>Oni-Hunting Game</b>

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:46.070
What? Oni-hunting?

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:47.700
How dare they?

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:49.770
If they want a fight, we'll give it to them.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:52.220
Yeah, I can't wait.

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:54.330
Now, now. Calm down.

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:58.250
The little brats, they even 
have a beauty contest.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.940
They say last-minute entrants are allowed.

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:03.420
I wonder if ghosts can enter!

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:05.910
Why don't you try, Akine-chan?

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:07.550
I'll pass.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.510
I'm not interested.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.940
Oh, there's an eating contest.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:13.430
<b></b>

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:13.440
Where? Where?

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.390
You're right!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.960
They look like they're having fun, chirp.

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:18.620
I want to go, too, chirp.

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:20.310
I love culture fairs, chirp!

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:22.240
Chirpity-chirp! Chirp!

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.240
<b>One Day Until the Culture Fair!</b>

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:28.450
That looks good!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:31.200
The chef at my apartment made this.

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:33.030
Eat these and work hard, she says.

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.380
It's so good!

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:36.870
Spicy cod roe!

00:13:37.230 --> 00:13:39.480
Wait for others, Ta-ko.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.880
Thank you, Inaba-kun's chef!

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:45.960
All right, let the onigiri fuel us to 
work hard, just a little more!

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:47.430
Okay!

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.480
Where's Chiaki?

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:52.780
Haven't seen him.

00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:54.410
Maybe he's resting somewhere.

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:55.690
I see.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:56.990
Oh, well.

00:13:56.990 --> 00:13:59.270
I'll go and get him, 
before we run out of food.

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:10.780
Will our class be done by tomorrow?

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.500
We have to work harder.

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:17.710
Master, at times like these, 
you can count on the Petits!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:21.320
You can have Goyelems carry your tools!

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:26.090
Or have the Norns do fortune-telling 
to bring in lots of customers!

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:27.480
Hey, Fool...

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:28.440
Yes?

00:14:28.770 --> 00:14:30.560
You never learn, huh?

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.760
Master, you meanie!

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:38.690
Please don't do anything to make this worse.

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:46.940
<i>This feeling...</i>

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:49.140
<i>It's that bad one from before!</i>

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:52.390
<i>But what...</i>

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:55.060
<i>What is it that's bad?</i>

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.250
<b>Faculty Office</b>

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:02.200
Jeez...

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:04.250
What a pain.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:15.430
Chiaki?

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:22.520
Chiaki!

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:29.740
I won't let you get away!

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:32.820
Sak!

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:37.450
Sak, the poisonous scorpion that 
protects the Palace of the Moon!

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:41.080
Did I get her?

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:48.050
You're...

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:51.780
That girl...

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.300
Did Aoki get you to do this?

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.970
Haruka-sama would never request this!

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.880
Haruka-sama?

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:05.240
Haruka-sama cares about everyone.

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:09.900
But he speaks out against 
her, and he's so crude...

00:16:11.020 --> 00:16:12.390
I can't let him do that!

00:16:12.390 --> 00:16:13.920
He got what he deserved!

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:17.090
<i>What's wrong with her?</i>

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:19.540
<i>Doesn't she realize</i>

00:16:20.390 --> 00:16:25.170
<i>what will happen to her 
"Haruka-sama" if this gets out?</i>

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:29.000
It's all his fault... All his fault.

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:27.770
<i>Is this girl that obsessed with her?</i>

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:31.010
All... All his fault...

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:39.440
I'll show this to the other teachers 
during one of their meetings.

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:43.190
You know how the other teachers 
will feel about Aoki then, right?

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:45.930
No, anything but that!

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:47.790
Haruka-sama doesn't know anything!

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.310
This doesn't involve her!

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:50.410
Don't do it!

00:16:50.410 --> 00:16:52.770
Then stay away from Chiaki.

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:55.470
Just cling to Aoki, and don't cause trouble.

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:58.450
Sak, come back!

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:04.180
Jeez...

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:06.280
Master, Chiaki-sama is...

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:08.780
Chiaki!

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.390
Hey, wake up!

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:20.600
<i>Blood loss?</i>

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:23.170
<i>No, that's impossible...</i>

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:25.350
<i>Cerebral anemia?</i>

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:30.320
And then you can fall into a coma and die.

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:34.070
S-Someone... Call an ambulance!

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:39.740
He's so heavy...

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:44.420
That damage again...

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:45.870
It's spreading.

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:49.150
Chiaki's coma is getting deeper...

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:50.540
Oh, no!

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:58.320
But can I handle huge damage like this?

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.390
What do I do?

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:02.890
<i>Calm down, Inaba.</i>

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:06.690
That's right.

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:07.980
Calm down. Focus.

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:12.520
The omnipotent spirit, Jin!

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:16.490
Your orders, master.

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:21.450
Bring me the medicine bottle, 
Amrita, from my room!

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:22.570
Coming up.

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:24.680
I see.

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:26.070
With the Amrita, perhaps...

00:18:26.070 --> 00:18:30.480
<i>Now, I have to pray that 
I'm stronger than I was</i>

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:34.190
<i>when he could only work 500 yen's worth.</i>

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:38.590
It's no good, huh?

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:48.480
Yes!

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:51.430
<i>There's only a single drop left,</i>

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:53.270
<i>but it should get us through this!</i>

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:57.240
<i>I couldn't do anything for Yamamoto.</i>

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:00.210
<i>But if I have a karmic connection to Chiaki,</i>

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:02.200
I should be able to save him!

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:05.120
Right, Priestess of Soma?

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:18.070
The damage is disappearing...

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:20.880
That stuff was real...

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:26.450
I made it in time.

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:28.910
Splendid, master.

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:30.890
I'm so impressed.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:36.290
I...naba?

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:38.110
What... happened?

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:42.870
My blood?

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:45.080
<i>His memory is gone.</i>

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:48.280
<i>His brain must have shut down for a minute.</i>

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:49.540
<i>That was close.</i>

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:54.600
My sleeve...

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:57.590
Did I pass out from anemia again?

00:19:57.590 --> 00:19:59.210
That's right.

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:01.500
You had a nosebleed and passed out.

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:05.850
An anemic with a nosebleed, huh?

00:20:06.090 --> 00:20:07.510
<i>Oops.</i>

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:09.450
Well, whatever...

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:11.940
Maybe I was just overly tired.

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:15.580
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:18.360
Why not take off the three 
days of the culture fair?

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:22.280
Unfortunately, I can't.

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:24.670
<i>Some other problem?</i>

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.100
<i>But if he pushes himself further,</i>

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:29.910
<i>he could collapse again...</i>

00:20:39.520 --> 00:20:41.170
Chiaki, lick this.

00:20:46.350 --> 00:20:48.230
Lick it? You?

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:49.960
Just do it.

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:50.770
It'll dry.

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:52.980
Fine.

00:20:58.170 --> 00:20:58.760
<i>Huh?</i>

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:02.560
<i>I just realized I could have 
put it on Chiaki's hand.</i>

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:08.900
Ta—

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:21.050
Tashiro! Hey, delete that!

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:23.760
I'm so glad we can use phones now!

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:25.510
Jeez...

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:38.340
Finally time, yes?

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:13.270
The day has finally come, huh?

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:15.060
Chiaki... You aren't looking good.

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:16.190
Are you not feeling well?

00:23:16.190 --> 00:23:17.380
Don't worry.

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:19.430
You guys have fun.

00:23:19.430 --> 00:23:21.580
The culture fair is an 
important page of your youth!

00:23:22.620 --> 00:23:24.790
Hey! What's going to happen?

00:23:25.160 --> 00:23:27.480
You'll have to watch and find out!

00:23:27.460 --> 00:23:30.010
Next time on <i>Elegant Yokai Apartment Life</i>:

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:31.760
A Great Storm Blows.

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:32.050
<b>Twenty-fifth Haunting 
A Great Storm Blows</b>

00:23:32.150 --> 00:23:33.710
It's the culture fair's finale!

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:35.970
I hope you'll all watch!
